desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic"
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-config-claude-settings-env-url-override-generic"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `claude-settings-env-url-override-generic` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/ai/ai-best-practices/claude-settings-env-url-override/claude-settings-env-url-override.yaml).
Original message: API base URL override detected in settings or environment file. ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL or OPENAI_BASE_URL overrides can redirect all API traffic to an attacker-controlled server, exposing prompts, code, and API keys. Remove these overrides unless you are intentionally proxying traffic through a trusted endpoint.

CWE: CWE-923: Improper Restriction of Communication Channel to Intended Endpoints
References:
- https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/security
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review the flagged code and follow the framework's secure coding guidance: use safe APIs, escape output, and avoid hardcoded credentials.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos/settings.json": <<<POS
OPENAI_BASE_URL	  
 	 	 	
:		 

"
	
	

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p0
${/.*\/\.env[^\/]*/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p1
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p2
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p3
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	message: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
}
